      "text": "son of Kib, father of Omer, Ether 1:30–31 (7:7; 8:1). is born in captivity, Ether 7:7. restores kingdom to father, Ether 7:8–9. rules righteously, Ether 7:11, 26–27. begets many children, Ether 7:12. gives Corihor1 power in kingdom, Ether 7:13. Noah2 rebels against Shule, Ether 7:15–16. Noah2 takes Shule captive, Ether 7:15–17. sons help Shule regain kingdom, Ether 7:18–22. Shule protects prophets, Ether 7:23–25.",
